== Trivia ==
*'''Duncan'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s skin is a reference to the Greek hero [[w:Heracles|Heracles]], or the Romanized Hero [[w:Hercules|Hercules]], son of Zeus/Jupiter known for his strength and his completion the Labours of Heracles. Heracles is depicted as wearing the skin of the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nemean%20lion Nemean lion] which he killed with his bare hands. This lion skin is found on the skin of '''Duncan'''.

